Replaces: mint-shelf (<= 0.1.0)
Description: native encrypted clipboard history for Cinnamon
 A GTK 4 shelf for searching, pinning, and restoring local clipboard history.
 SQLCipher encrypts history using a key held in the desktop Secret Service.
 X11 supports capture; native Wayland supports browsing and restoration only.
